ican " [:a {:href "/athletes/60643"} "Greg Gibson"] " had won two silvers and a bronze at the 1981-83 World Championships, but in freestyle. When he was upset by " [:a {:href "/athletes/60568"} "Lou Banach"] " at the US Freestyle Trials, Gibson opted to try for the US team in Greco-Roman and succeeded. Banach would win the gold medal in freestyle heavyweight. The favorite in this class was Romanian " [:a {:href "/athletes/59750"} "Vasile Andrei"] ", silver medalist at the 1982 World Championships. With only eight wrestlers in the division, Gibson and Andrei won Groups A and B, respectively, and met for the gold medal. Andrei dominated Gibson, who was new to the style, winning on technical superiority, 12-0, at 4:16 of the match."] "\n"] [:table {:class "table table-striped"} [:thead {} [:tr {} [:th {} "Pos"] [:th {} "Number"] [:th {} "Competitor"] [:th {} "NOC"] [:th {}] [:th {}] [:th {}]]] [:tbody {} [:tr {:class "", :style ""} [:td {} "1"] [:td {:class "bib"} "201"] [:td {} [:a {:href "/athletes/59750"} "Vasile Andrei"]] [:td {} [:a {:href "/countries/ROU"} [:img {:style "padding-right: 2px; vertical-align: middle", :src "https://olympedia-flags.s3.eu-central-1.amazonaws.com/ROU.png"}] "ROU"]] [:td {} [:span {:class "Gold"} "Gold"]] [:td {}] [:td {}]] [:tr {:class "", :style ""} [:td {} "2"] [:td {:class "bib"} "259"] [:td {} [:a {:href "/athletes/60643"} "Greg Gibson"]] [:td {} [:a {:href "/countries/USA"} [:img {:style "padding-right: 2px; vertical-align: middle", :src "https://olympedia-flags.s3.eu-central-1.amazonaws.com/USA.png"}] "USA"]] [:td {} [:span {:class "Silver"} "Silver"]] [:td {}] [:td {}]] [:tr {:class "", :style ""} [:td {} "3"] [:td {:class "bib"} "276"] [:td {} [:a {:href "/athletes/60892"} "Jožef Tertei"]] [:td {} [:a {:href "/countries/YUG"} [:img {:style "padding-right: 2px; vertical-align: middle", :src "https://olympedia-flags.s3.eu-central-1.amazonaws.com/YUG.png"}] "YUG"]] [:td {} [:span {:class "Bronze"} "Bronze"]] [:td {}] [:td {}]] [:t